{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute</strong> is a short active incremental game about reducing the world\u2019s population from 8 billion to zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture people</strong> \u2013 gather victims for your machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12e8e537bdf68c0d2ffcf7f24c813dfa.poster.avif?t=1765249571\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12e8e537bdf68c0d2ffcf7f24c813dfa.webm?t=1765249571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12e8e537bdf68c0d2ffcf7f24c813dfa.mp4?t=1765249571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute</strong> \u2013 start with a guillotine, then unlock new methods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/acda73d402f94775cd566378a5a46d61.poster.avif?t=1765249571\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/acda73d402f94775cd566378a5a46d61.webm?t=1765249571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/acda73d402f94775cd566378a5a46d61.mp4?t=1765249571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your arsenal</strong> \u2013 mines, contraptions, and machines that scale with your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as